@startuml

skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam shadowing false

|Project Owner|
start
:Open project membership management;
:Choose to add a project member;

|System|
:Request an existing User account;

|Project Owner|
:Select a User
and confirm the addition;

|System|
:Verify the selected User's
account and membership status;

if (Target User account active?) then ([active])
    if (Already a project member?) then ([already a member])
        :Report that no new
        membership is required;
    else ([not a member])
        :Create project membership;
        :Refresh the project member list;
    endif
else ([inactive])
    :Report that the selected
    User account is inactive;
endif

stop

@enduml
